      "raw": "<p>Apologies if this has come up before.</p><p>Had a game last night where Omnitron-X had some components out and had taken 3 damage in the villain turn. He was healed for 2 points by Tempest during the hero turn, but then took 2 damage in the environment turn. We ruled that since he had taken 5 damage over the course of the turn his components were destroyed. Should he have lost his components?</p>",
