    {
      "id": 120086,
      "name": "Matchstickman",
      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-11-04T10:00:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Nope, it's a turn, not a round.</p><p>The villain, each hero and the environment are separate turns. So anything that references a turn is referring not to one complete go around, but to the individual 'portion' where a single hero, villain or environment act.</p><p>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in just the Villain Turn then it loses it's components.&nbsp;<span>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span>just&nbsp;</span><span>the Environment Turn&nbsp;</span><span>then it loses it's components.&nbsp;</span><span>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span>just&nbsp;</span><span>Hero 1's Turn then it loses it's components.&nbsp;</span><span>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span>just&nbsp;</span><span>Hero 2's Turn then it loses it's components.&nbsp;</span><span>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span>just&nbsp;</span><span>Hero 3's Turn then it loses it's components. etc etc.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>The healing has no impact on '</span><span>the count' of&nbsp;</span><span>how much damage Omnitron-X takes in a turn.</span></p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:53:28.106Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 11486,
      "topic_slug": "omnitron-x-taking-damage",
      "display_username": "Matchstickman",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
