      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Nope, it&#39;s a turn, not a round.</p><p>The villain, each hero and the environment are separate turns. So anything that references a turn is referring not to one complete go around, but to the individual &#39;portion&#39; where a single hero, villain or environment act.</p><p>If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in just the Villain Turn then it loses it&#39;s components.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">just&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">the Environment Turn&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">then it loses it&#39;s components.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">just&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Hero 1&#39;s Turn then it loses it&#39;s components.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">just&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Hero 2&#39;s Turn then it loses it&#39;s components.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">If Omnitron-X takes 5 damage in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">just&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Hero 3&#39;s Turn then it loses it&#39;s components. etc etc.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">The healing has no impact on &#39;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">the count&#39; of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">how much damage Omnitron-X takes in a turn.</span></p>",
